    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just hard to see the point in \"one moment at a time\" when every moment feels like a struggle. the doctors say my body is failing, and honestly, it feels like i'm just a burden to everyone now. it feels like i've lost all my dignity, just waiting for something to happen to me. i wish i could just... decide for myself when it's over.",
